msgctxt "77\t412"
msgid ""
"So Toma left to get the land for the resort on his own.\\n"
"And the man he went to for help... was Mine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "418\t472"
msgid "Precisely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "478\t560"
msgid "Not sure that makes much sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564\t773"
msgid ""
"If Kashiwagi's info was right, the ones pulling\\n"
"the strings on the resort were Suzuki, Joji Kazama..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "775\t931"
msgid ""
"And an organization within the Tojo\\n"
"that Joji was working with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940\t1054"
msgid "The truth of the matter is complicated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1061\t1302"
msgid ""
"Ever since the Tamashiro incident two years ago...\\n"
"not one parcel of land has been purchased for the resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1307\t1363"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1366\t1502"
msgid ""
"Then why'd Kazama go as far as\\n"
"shooting Nakahara for his deed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1514\t1624"
msgid "To keep the military expansion bill alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1632\t1826"
msgid ""
"If word got out that land acquisition\\n"
"had stalled, so too would the bill itself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1829\t1934"
msgid ""
"And Black Monday would slip\\n"
"through our fingers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1938\t2185"
msgid ""
"Hence, the most prudent option was intimidating\\n"
"Nakahara, essentially forcing him to give up his land."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2200\t2275"
msgid "And he used the Tojo to do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2281\t2402"
msgid "Yes. In order to get Daigo Dojima on their side..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2406\t2618"
msgid ""
"The CIA stole the deed to the plot Morning Glory\\n"
"rests upon in an attempt to force his hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2636\t2682"
msgid "However..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2685\t2802"
msgid "Daigo didn't take the bait."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2806\t2882"
msgid "So they shot him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2888\t2948"
msgid "I believe so, yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2951\t3101"
msgid ""
"That's when Toma brought the issue\\n"
"of the halted land accrual to Mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3105\t3322"
msgid ""
"No doubt he promised Mine full control of\\n"
"the finished resort in exchange for his assistance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3331\t3510"
msgid ""
"Full control of the resort?\\n"
"How would that benefit Toma?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3527\t3696"
msgid ""
"You're aware that he was born\\n"
"and raised in Okinawa, yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3699\t3872"
msgid "Yeah. He told us as much himself last summer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3889\t4142"
msgid ""
"Three years ago, Toma stepped into the political world,\\n"
"hoping to enact serious change in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4147\t4474"
msgid ""
"And when he learned of the base and the resort,\\n"
"he was determined to help for the sake of his home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4477\t4624"
msgid ""
"Yeah... He did say something about\\n"
"wanting to see Okinawa flourish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4633\t4753"
msgid "It's the only thing he's ever cared about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4762\t4957"
msgid ""
"When the link between the resort and the yakuza\\n"
"was almost made public last year..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4959\t5183"
msgid ""
"Toma introduced me to the Tojo Clan's Chairman Dojima\\n"
"to ensure the base didn't go down with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5203\t5458"
msgid ""
"However, he never truly cared for my base.\\n"
"Keeping the resort afloat was his ultimate goal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5472\t5702"
msgid ""
"And... I guess Toma first ran into Mine when he\\n"
"brought you there to talk strategy with Daigo, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5721\t5881"
msgid ""
"He then found out a year later that\\n"
"everything I was working towards was all fake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5884\t6091"
msgid ""
"So with the resort deal fully in mind,\\n"
"he approached the Hakuho Clan to form a pact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6111\t6265"
msgid ""
"Toma and Mine are working toward a common goal,\\n"
"albeit for different reasons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6288\t6345"
msgid "Well all right then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6352\t6523"
msgid ""
"Never thought Mine'd betray the clan, though.\\n"
"He's always been like Daigo's loyal lapdog."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6562\t6670"
msgid "I can't say I understand the man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6697\t6880"
msgid ""
"But with all that's happened,\\n"
"he's now the de facto head of the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6883\t7070"
msgid ""
"Power would be his if he just waited quietly...\\n"
"So why make this move now?"
msgstr ""